{
  "description": "An inserted token with a phoneme tag has that phoneme as its label, so the apostrophe that the zbalermorna shorthand U+ED8B inserts stays in the label of the word U+ED8B U+EDA4 U+EDA2, `u'i` (engine §5, §11).",
  "documents": {
    "p.md": "## phonemes\n\n```jbogenbau\n%stage phonemes\n```\n\n- [g.md](g.md)\n  ```jbogenbau\n  %include \"g.md\"\n  ```\n\n## words\n\n```jbogenbau\n%stage words\n```\n\n- [h.md](h.md)\n  ```jbogenbau\n  %include \"h.md\"\n  ```\n",
    "g.md": "```jbogenbau\n%ambiguity-resolution greedy\n%rule text [{part}]\n%rule part vowel | shorthand\n%rule vowel '\\u{EDA4}' </u/> | '\\u{EDA2}' </i/>\n%emits $\n%rule shorthand '\\u{ED8B}' $v(vowel)\n%emits $v, /'/\n```\n",
    "h.md": "```jbogenbau\n%ambiguity-resolution greedy\n%rule text $w(word)\n%emits $w <W>\n%rule word [{phoneme}]\n%rule phoneme /u/ | /i/ | /'/\n```\n"
  },
  "pipeline": "p.md",
  "input": "",
  "expect": {
    "result": {
      "ok": true,
      "stages": [
        {
          "output": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "phonemes": "u",
              "label": "u",
              "span": [
                1,
                2
              ],
              "source": [
                1,
                2
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "",
              "phonemes": "'",
              "label": "'",
              "span": [
                2,
                2
              ],
              "source": [
                2,
                2
              ],
              "insertedBy": "shorthand"
            },
            {
              "text": "",
              "phonemes": "i",
              "label": "i",
              "span": [
                2,
                3
              ],
              "source": [
                2,
                3
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "output": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "phonemes": "u'i",
              "label": "u'i",
              "span": [
                0,
                3
              ],
              "source": [
                1,
                3
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
